The text of the acts in this repository is not protected by copyright. Article 9 of Slovenia's Copyright and
Related Rights Act (Zakon o avtorski in sorodnih pravicah, ZASP; Uradni list RS, št. 16/07 - uradno prečiščeno
besedilo, 68/08, 110/13, 56/15, 63/16 - ZKUASP, 59/19 in 130/22), as published in PIS, reads:

    (1) Avtorskopravno niso varovane:
    1. ideje, načela, odkritja;
    2. uradna besedila z zakonodajnega, upravnega in sodnega področja;
    3. ljudske književne in umetniške stvaritve.

    ("Not protected by copyright: ... 2. official texts in the legislative, administrative and judicial field.")

Source of the text: PIS, Pravno-informacijski sistem Republike Slovenije (https://pisrs.si), maintained by the
Služba Vlade Republike Slovenije za zakonodajo (Government Office for Legislation). Its terms of use
(https://pisrs.si, "Pogoji uporabe") state that use of the site is free, that the information on it is for
information only, and that it is not the original except for the electronic edition of the Uradni list Republike
Slovenije. Every consolidated text in PIS carries the notice: "Opozorilo: Neuradno prečiščeno besedilo predpisa
predstavlja zgolj informativni delovni pripomoček, glede katerega organ ne jamči odškodninsko ali kako drugače."
Only the Uradni list Republike Slovenije is authoritative.

